Gökyüzü sky data (compiled into the `sky` binary from apps/sky/skydata.c, generated by tools/sky/gen_skydata.py)

1. Stars: Yale Bright Star Catalogue, 5th Revised Edition (Hoffleit & Warren 1991), CDS catalogue V/50
   (https://cdsarc.cds.unistra.fr/viz-bin/cat/V/50). Public domain: distributed by NASA's NSSDC/ADC and CDS
   without restriction.

2. Constellation figures: d3-celestial by Olaf Frohn, data/constellations.lines.json
   (https://github.com/ofrohn/d3-celestial, commit 7e720a3), under the BSD 3-Clause License below.

3. Sun, Moon and planet positions are computed from the orbital elements published by Paul Schlyter,
   "How to compute planetary positions" (https://stjarnhimlen.se/comp/ppcomp.html); no data is copied.

